This is a simple Ethiopian Birr (ETB) currency converter built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The app uses the Frankfurter API to load currency names and live exchange rates, so currencies do not need to be manually added to the dropdown. Users can enter an amount, choose a currency, convert ETB to the selected currency, or use the reverse option to convert back to ETB. The app also includes loading and error messages, input validation, a refresh button for updated rates, and a last-updated time. Each successful conversion is saved in the browser using localStorage and displayed as conversion history, which remains available after refreshing the page. The project can be run by opening index.html in a browser or using Live Server in VS Code.